    {
      "name": "Circuitborn",
      "type": "species",
      "img": "art/bbttcc/GOTTGAIT/BBTTCC_Character_Options/Circuitborn_1.png",
      "system": {
        "category": "ancestry",
        "source": "Bad Eden (2024 rules)",
        "tags": [],
        "description": {
          "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Circuitborn.</strong> Normalized Bad Eden ancestry root.</p><p>Select one heritage separately when building the character: <strong>Exo-Knight, Parallax, Salvage, Synapse</strong>.</p><p>This root grants the shared Circuitborn core trait package (<em>Firmware of Identity</em>) and preserves live UUID compatibility for the four Line items.</p><p><em>\u201cYou are not a robot. You are a decision the world keeps making about itself. The networks are alive and they recognize you on sight.\u201d</em></p><p><strong>Firmware of Identity.</strong> You do not eat, drink, or sleep. You enter <em>maintenance trance</em> when you rest. You reroll the lowest die on checks against poison and disease, and you are immune to magical sleep.</p><p><strong>Attention Resonance.</strong> 1/Soma Break, when a creature you can see is intensely focused on you, you may regain either one spent Bad Eden OP (a category you used this scene) or Integrity equal to your tier.</p><p><strong>Informational Matrix Sense.</strong> You can feel active networks: radio, signal, ritual, rumor.</p><p><strong>Line Memory.</strong> Choose one Circuitborn line (Exo-Knight, Parallax, Salvage, Synapse). Your line grants Tier powers as you level.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
